// Sheet: pure control zone, explicitly "No damage" -- heavily obscured
// (blind) + slippery difficult terrain over a wide area. Combines this
// batch's two already-shipped single-rider precedents directly, same as
// web.ron: `Blinded` at fog_cloud.ron's own strength (0.4, "wrapped in a
// blinding gray haze" matches this spell's own obscuring-storm flavor
// closely) and `DifficultTerrain` at grease.ron's strength band (0.4,
// "slippery footing"). No damage rider to drop -- this is the cleanest
// sheet-fidelity case in the batch. Sheet footprint is a 40 ft radius / 20
// ft tall cylinder, approximated as a sphere of the same radius (12 m),
// same shape-approximation precedent as every other zone in this pipeline.
// `StaticAura` always places the zone at the caster's own position -- the
// sheet's 46 m cast range isn't mechanically expressed, same simplification
// as entangle/fog_cloud/grease.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.45,
    energy_cost: 80.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Blinded, strength: 0.4, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
        (kind: DifficultTerrain, strength: 0.4, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(25.0),
    range: 12.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
